{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"artifacthub/community-operators/shipwright-operator","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:16:59.267Z","source":{"name":"Artifact Hub","api":"https://artifacthub.io/api/v1/packages/olm/community-operators/shipwright-operator","page":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/olm/community-operators/shipwright-operator"},"readme":"Shipwright is a framework for building container images on Kubernetes.\n\nRead more: [https://shipwright.io](https://shipwright.io)\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing the Shipwright operator, ensure the following components are installed:\n- **Tekton**: Follow the [Tekton installation instructions](https://tekton.dev/docs/setup/) to install Tekton Pipelines.\n- **cert-manager**: Follow the [cert-manager installation instructions](https://cert-manager.io/docs/installation/) to install cert-manager for webhook certificate provisioning.\n\n## Usage\n\nTo deploy and manage [Shipwright Builds](https://github.com/shipwright-io/build) in your cluster,\nfirst make sure this operator is installed and running on your cluster.\n\nNext, create the following:\n\n```yaml\n---\napiVersion: operator.shipwright.io/v1alpha1\nkind: ShipwrightBuild\nmetadata:\n  name: shipwright-operator\nspec:\n  targetNamespace: shipwright-build\n```\n\nThe operator will deploy Shipwright Builds in the provided `targetNamespace`.\nWhen `.spec.targetNamespace` is not set, the namespace will default to `shipwright-build`.\nRefer to the [ShipwrightBuild documentation](https://github.com/shipwright-io/operator/blob/main/docs/shipwrightbuild.md) for more information about this custom resource.","readmeBase":"https://github.com/k8s-operatorhub/community-operators/operators","publisher":{"name":"Operator Framework","url":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/search?org=operator-framework","official":false,"verified":false,"cncf":false},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","categories":["Integration and delivery"],"keywords":["build","shipwright","tekton","cicd","Developer Tools"],"license":null,"links":[{"name":"Documentation","url":"https://shipwright.io"},{"name":"Shipwright Builds","url":"https://github.com/shipwright-io/build"},{"name":"source","url":"https://github.com/shipwright-io/operator"},{"name":"Community Operators repository","url":"https://github.com/k8s-operatorhub/community-operators/operators"}],"maintainers":[{"name":"The Shipwright Contributors","email":"shipwright-dev@lists.shipwright.io"}],"stats":{"pulls":null,"stars":4,"subscriptions":0},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"0.13.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null},{"name":"0.11.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null},{"name":"0.12.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null},{"name":"0.15.2","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null},{"name":"0.16.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null},{"name":"0.10.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null},{"name":"0.14.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null},{"name":"0.7.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null},{"name":"0.17.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null},{"name":"0.8.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-02-16T15:32:38.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"stat